uld be executed during that same `pnpm test` command.\n\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\nN/A\n\n**Additional context**\nN/A\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/outerbase/starbasedb/issues/71/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/outerbase/starbasedb/issues/71/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}